s"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Underwater sensors capture porpoises’ rare distress calls off Cornwall]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133937553.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/wildlife/underwater-sensors-caught-a-rare-event-off-cornwall-one-porpoise-became-trapped-in-a-net-while-two-animals-exchanged-possible-distress-calls/articleshow/133937553.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/wildlife/underwater-sensors-caught-a-rare-event-off-cornwall-one-porpoise-became-trapped-in-a-net-while-two-animals-exchanged-possible-distress-calls/articleshow/133937553.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-10T00:52:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133937690,imgsize-628075.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[17 pigs rescued before New Zealand island’s feral population was eradicated]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133931189.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/in-1807-pigs-were-released-on-new-zealands-auckland-islands-as-food-for-castaways-192-years-later-17-were-rescued-before-the-feral-population-was-eradicated/articleshow/133931189.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/in-1807-pigs-were-released-on-new-zealands-auckland-islands-as-food-for-castaways-192-years-later-17-were-rescued-before-the-feral-population-was-eradicated/articleshow/133931189.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-10T00:48:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133931279,imgsize-135950.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Kesha sells Los Angeles mansion for $6.68 million after two years on the market]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133980495.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Kesha has sold her sprawling Los Angeles mansion for $6.68 million, nearly two years after first listing the property. The singer purchased the Mar Vista home for $4.95 million in 2020 and stands to make almost $1.7 million before expenses. The seven-bedroom estate features a pool, rooftop deck, guest house and music room.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/in-2020-kesha-bought-a-los-angeles-mansion-for-4-95-million-after-a-5-95-million-listing-and-7-million-relisting-it-sold-for-6-68-million-1-73-million-above-her-purchase-price/articleshow/133980495.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/in-2020-kesha-bought-a-los-angeles-mansion-for-4-95-million-after-a-5-95-million-listing-and-7-million-relisting-it-sold-for-6-68-million-1-73-million-above-her-purchase-price/articleshow/133980495.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-10T00:06:33+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Real Estate Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133980690,imgsize-119803.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Sea otters returned to a California estuary; eelgrass expanded 600%, marsh-edge erosion slowed 69%]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133924103.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Sea otters returned to California’s Elkhorn Slough in 1984 when pollution had severely affected its ecosystem. Their recovery triggered changes across the food web, helping eel